<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Emerging Technologies Portal</title>
</head>
<body>
    <header>
        <h1>Emerging Technologies Information Portal</h1>
    </header>

    <main>
        <section>
            <h2>Introduction</h2>
            <p>Emerging technologies make life <b>easier</b> and work <strong>faster</strong>.</p>
            <p>They support <i>innovation</i>, <em>learning</em>, and <u>research</u>.</p>
            <p>Water is H<sub>2</sub>O. 2<sup>3</sup> = 8.</p>
            <p><mark>Artificial Intelligence</mark> is an important technology.</p>
            <p><del>Old method</del> <ins>New method</ins>: <s>obsolete idea</s>.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Ordered List: Technologies</h2>
            <ol>
                <li>Artificial Intelligence</li>
                <li>Cloud Computing</li>
                <li>Cyber Security</li>
            </ol>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Unordered List: Web Skills</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>HTML</li>
                <li>CSS</li>
                <li>JavaScript</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Definitions</h2>
            <dl>
                <dt>HTML</dt>
                <dd>Structures a webpage.</dd>
                <dt>CSS</dt>
                <dd>Styles a webpage.</dd>
                <dt>JavaScript</dt>
                <dd>Adds interaction to a webpage.</dd>
            </dl>
        </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; Emerging Technologies Portal Web Programming Lab</p>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>
